title: ch17_after_the_blank_page
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
@letterbox on
@camera D11
@music silence fade=1.0
@mark rhen deck_rail walk
@wait 3.0
@mark kerrid deck_rail_b walk
@wait 4.0
Kerrid [neutral]: He was first down the stair. He'd have been first into that, too. #line:ch17_blank_001
@wait 5.0
@anim kerrid look_at sea
@wait 4.0
@fade out 2.0
@letterbox off
